Task #742: Purge revoked Supabase admin token from git history

Summary
- Purged the revoked Supabase admin token (already rotated in Task #723)
  from the full git history using `git filter-repo --replace-text`.
- Replaced every historical occurrence of the literal token value (across
  all commits, branches, and refs) with the sentinel string
  `REDACTED_SUPABASE_TOKEN_TASK723`.

Procedure
1. Enumerated affected commits with `git log --all -p -S "<token>"`
   (9 commits across `.replit` and doc references).
2. Wrote replacement rule to `/tmp/replacements.txt`.
3. Ran `git filter-repo --replace-text /tmp/replacements.txt --force`
   (17,123 commits parsed; history rewritten in ~33s; full repack ~53s).
4. Verified: `git log --all -p -S "<token>"` returns no matches;
   working-tree grep for the token also returns no matches.

